# Example output of riceKB/plantTFDB.py's RDFRegulate -- Arabidopsis
# thaliana, but only the first 10000 rows of the real
# regulation_merged_Ath.txt (687733 rows total), to keep this sample a
# size comparable to the other examples in this directory. Not the full
# per-species regulation RDF the pipeline actually produces (~72MB on the
# complete input).
